From b2b451e3f61962ba68d9cd5ecaa59d805ad08e60 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 05:09:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Kazakh (kz) as a full third interface language
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Add complete kz translation block to I18N (214 keys, full parity with ru/en)
- Generalize pName/pDesc/pType/shortName to work with any LANG suffix
- Add name_kz/type_kz/desc_kz fields to all 20 regions in data.js (1926 okrugs + 1939 oblasts)
- Add kz translations to SCHOOLS, CAMPS, REVOLTS, FLOWS, FAMINES, STORY, QUIZ, BIBLIOGRAPHY
- Add kz to MODELS labels and OPT_LETTERS
- Convert ~39 scattered "en"===LANG two-way ternaries to three-way (table headers,
  CSV/GeoJSON export strings, calculator text, quiz counters, locale codes, About modal)
- Wire up Kazakh support in the offline AI assistant: KB_KZ knowledge base (15 static +
  3 dynamic entries), STOP_KZ stopwords, Kazakh-aware tokenizer regex, SYS_KZ system
  prompt, and kz branches for context/no-context message templates
- Add Қазақша language switcher button to index.html

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N1eFfP7CPRznqEZ957XMFc
